column7:
The Open Government Data Masterplan 2024 - 2027 contains Principle 5 with the goal 10 “The impact of OGD is regularly measured and communicated”. The following indicators are used.
- Number of datasets, showcases and data stories by theme;
- Portal usage statistics (e.g. via Matomo Analytics);
- Impact monitoring using the method recommended by data.europe.eu (KPI).
URL: https://www.bfs.admin.ch/bfs/fr/home/services/ogd/masterplan.html
